  <div class="step-label">Step 5</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Export tonight's music with Rekordbox</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Rekordbox in <span class="mono">EXPORT</span> mode, USB connected.</li>
    <li>Drag <strong>tonight's playlists only</strong> onto the device. Small export = fast and reliable.</li>
    <li>No Rekordbox library on this computer? Import the music folder you backed up first, then export it.</li>
    <li>Wait for the full sync, then eject with the Rekordbox eject button.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Export finished without errors?</p>

  <Choice step="qf_export"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/quick-fix/verify', label: 'YES — EXPORT COMPLETE' }}
